---
// Location & Interactive Google Maps Component
---
<div class="bg-muted" id="kontak">
  <section class="section-container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-subtitle">Lokasi & Kontak</span>
      <h2>Akses Mudah di Bobong</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Terletak strategis di pusat kota Bobong, dekat dengan fasilitas publik dan perkantoran.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-info-panel">
        <div class="info-block">
          <div class="info-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 10.5c0 7.142-7.5 11.25-7.5 11.25s-7.5-4.108-7.5-11.25a7.5 7.5 0 1115 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="info-text">
            <h4>Alamat Utama</h4>
            <p>Bobong, Kec. Taliabu Barat, Kabupaten Pulau Taliabu, Maluku Utara.</p>
            <p class="text-hint text-muted">Akses jalan utama mudah dijangkau kendaraan roda dua maupun roda empat.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="info-block">
          <div class="info-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 01-7.143-7.143c-.162-.441.004-.928.38-1.21l1.293-.97c.363-.271.527-.734.417-1.173L6.963 3.102a1.125 1.125 0 00-1.091-.852H4.5A2.25 2.25 0 002.25 4.5v2.25z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="info-text">
            <h4>Pengelola / Narahubung</h4>
            <p><strong>Kak Ona:</strong> +62 813-5700-1357</p>
            <p class="text-hint text-muted">Hubungi via WhatsApp atau telepon langsung untuk survei unit kamar.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Bobong,+Pulau+Taliabu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary btn-block" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px;">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 10.5c0 7.142-7.5 11.25-7.5 11.25s-7.5-4.108-7.5-11.25a7.5 7.5 0 1115 0z" />
          </svg>
          Buka Navigasi di Aplikasi Google Maps
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Interactive Google Maps Card -->
      <div class="map-visual-card">
        <div class="map-header">
          <h4>Google Maps Interaktif</h4>
          <span>Pusat Kota Bobong</span>
        </div>
        <div class="map-body-gmap">
          <iframe 
            src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Bobong,+Taliabu+Barat,+Pulau+Taliabu&t=&z=15&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed" 
            class="gmap-iframe"
            title="Lokasi Kos Fitrah di Google Maps"
            loading="lazy"
            allowfullscreen>
          </iframe>
          <div class="map-notes">
            <span class="landmark-bullet"></span>
            <p>Hanya 5 menit dari Pelabuhan Bobong dan dekat pusat perkantoran Pulau Taliabu.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
